Draft vs generated output

Editable user-owned draft

The draft is the current garden structure and settings:
	•	garden basics
	•	place/location
	•	goal/mode
	•	areas
	•	rows
	•	notes/logs
	•	planted status

Generated output

ELK produces:
	•	plan summary
	•	timing guidance
	•	generated tasks

These are derived from the draft and should be stored separately.

